  "interpretation": "M2.74 is a texture-quality promotion rather than a pure unified-loss promotion. It doubles the number of satin-like texture switches, improves coverage, strict precision, adaptive coverage, and adaptive precision, keeps hard_fail and visible connectors at zero, and does not increase off-mask stitch length. The cost is a small increase in unified loss and jump count, which is expected when adding separate satin-like texture layers.",
